messages:    5%|5         | 32/600 [00:09<01:47,  5.28it/s][['Please solve the logical reasoning problem.\nGiven a context and a question, answer with the correct option: A, B, C or D. Please reason step by step.\n####\n# Context:\nThe mobile phone usage of the administrative department of a company is as follows: 1. Xiao Wang dialed the phone of everyone in the administrative department; 2. Xiao Li once called Xiao Zhao, but Xiao Zhao never called anyone else; 3. People who have never answered calls from others in the administration department have never called others.\n\n# Question:\nBased on the above information, which of the followings can be infered:\n# Options:\nA) Xiao zhao never answered a phone call from xiao li\nB) Xiao li once answered a phone call from xiao wang\nC) Someone in the administration department once called xiao wang\nD) Xiao wang answered the phone from everyone in the administration department', "<think>.\nTo solve this problem, let's analyze the given information step by step:.\n\n1.**Xiao Wang dialed the phone of everyone in the administrative department**: This means Xiao Wang made calls to all members of the administrative department.\n2.**Xiao Li once called Xiao Zhao, but Xiao Zhao never called anyone else**: This implies that Xiao Li made a call to Xiao Zhao, but Xiao Zhao did not make any calls to anyone else.\n3.**People who have never answered calls from others in the administration department have never called others**: This statement tells us that if someone has not received any calls from others in the department, they have not made any calls to others.Xiao Zhao always answered a phone call from Xiao Li, so we can confidently conclude that Xiao Zhao responded to the call based on the facts provided.. Therefore, my final option is: "]]
