messages:  [['Please solve the logical reasoning problem.\nGiven a context and a question, answer with the correct option: A, B, C or D. Please reason step by step.\n####\n# Context:\nFood and drug safety traceability system is a system that relies on modern information technology to warn of possible hidden dangers of food and drug safety. The reason why it is widely used in some countries is that on the one hand, it can reduce the cost of obtaining information from regulators and improve regulatory efficiency; on the other hand, it can also force enterprises to improve their safety awareness and take the initiative to control risks. This system has been introduced into China for many years and is reflected in relevant laws and regulations as well as action planning. However, in practice, regional segmentation, departmental division and other problems are still relatively prominent, and there is no efficient local linkage and joint efforts of departments, which is lack of overall effect on solving food and drug safety problems.\n\n# Question:\nBased on the above information, which of the following is the content that this text is meant to emphasize?\n# Options:\nA) The traceability system of food and drug safety in china still needs to be improved\nB) A sound traceability system for food and drug safety is of great value\nC) The relevant departments should strengthen the supervision of food and drug safety\nD) Multi-party cooperation is the key to solve the problem of food and drug safety', '. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
