local environmental protection department strengthened the supervision of seriously polluting enterprises, and its serious law enforcement attitude was highly praised by the local people.\n- This option describes a situation where an administrative body (the environmental protection department) is enforcing regulations and being praised by the public.This is an example of administrative action being evaluated by the public, which fits the definition of object administrative culture.\n\nB) Xiao wang is a staff member of a government department.His work is serious and responsible.His leaders and comrades in charge think Xiao wang is a qualified worker.\n- This option describes a situation where an administrative subject (Xiao wang) is evaluated by his superiors based on his work performance.While this is an administrative evaluation, it does not involve the evaluation of the administrative subject by individuals, groups, or organizations outside the administrative system, which is a key aspect of object administrative culture.The tax department issued a notice to Zhang, the self-employed operator, to pay taxes as required, but he promptly complied and thanked the tax department for their diligence.. Therefore, my final option is: "]]
