es the maturity and popularity of the city.The context mentions that the city takes several years to mature and popularity does not gather in a day.This option aligns well with the context and supports the point of view.\n\nSmall cities have small populations and are poorly developed.\n- This option suggests that small cities are poorly developed, which contradicts the idea that small cities are well matured.\n\nBased on the analysis, option B best supports the given point of view. Therefore, the correct answer is B.\n</think>.\n<answer>\n. Therefore, my final option is: "]]
