messages:  [['Please solve the logical reasoning problem.\nGiven a context and a question, answer with the correct option: A, B, C or D. Please reason step by step.\n####\n# Context:\nIf absolute fairness is implemented, it will inevitably lead to distribution according to work; If distribution according to work, there will be inequality between the rich and the poor; Only by equalizing the rich and the poor can absolute fairness be implemented.\n\n# Question:\nBased on the above information, so\n# Options:\nA) Distribution according to work must be implemented\nB) Distribution on demand must be implemented\nC) Absolute fairness must be implemented\nD) Can not implement absolute fairness', "<think>.\nTo solve this logical reasoning problem, let's break down the given statements and analyze them step by step:.\n\n1.**Statement 1**: If absolute fairness is implemented, it will inevitably lead to distribution according to work.\n2.**Statement 2**: If distribution according to work, there will be inequality between the rich and the poor.\n3.**Statement 3**: Only by equalizing the rich and the poor can absolute fairness be implemented.Absolute fairness does not lead to distribution according to work, so this option must be correct.. Therefore, my final option is: "]]
