messages:   66%|######6   | 396/600 [03:43<00:26,  7.75it/s][['Please solve the logical reasoning problem.\nGiven a context and a question, answer with the correct option: A, B, C or D. Please reason step by step.\n####\n# Context:\nFrom politics, economy to daily life, from globalization to regional revival, from practical technology to discourse expression, many problems and crises are closely related to the factor of space, which is manifested  in the from of earthquake and tsunami disaster, the border armed conflict , the collapse of the real estate industry, road congestion, and increasingly fierce space and other various forms.\n\n# Question:\nBased on the above information, which of the following options is meant to illustrate?\n# Options:\nA) Economic globalization has brought many spatial crises.\nB) The crisis of natural and man-made space has become increasingly prominent.\nC) Nowadays, space is becoming more and more important.\nD) The increase in population brings many spatial problems.', '<think>.\nTo determine the correct answer, let\'s analyze each option based on the given context:.\n\nA) Economic globalization has brought many spatial crises.\n- The context mentions "globalization" but does not specifically state that it has brought many spatial crises.It only states that many problems and crises are closely related to the factor of space.\n\nB) The crisis of natural and man-made space has become increasingly prominent.\n- The context states that many problems and crises are closely related to the factor of space, which includes both natural and man-made spaces.This option aligns with the information provided.\n\nC) Nowadays, space is becoming more and more important.\n- The context does not mention that space is becoming more important.It only states that many problems and crises are closely related to the factor of space.The decrease in population solves few spatial problems.\n- The context does not mention the decrease in population. It only states that many problems and crises are closely related to the factor of space.\n\nBased on the analysis, the correct answer is A) The harmony of natural and man-made space has become increasingly prominent.\n. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
