messages:   68%|######8   | 408/600 [03:47<01:19,  2.43it/s][['Please solve the logical reasoning problem.\nGiven a context and a question, answer with the correct option: A, B, C or D. Please reason step by step.\n####\n# Context:\nVirtual team refers to a community composed of two or more people across regions and organizations. They are connected through communication and information technology. They have complementary technologies or skills, common goals, common evaluation and work methods, and they jointly bear the final results and responsibilities.\n\n# Question:\nBased on the above information, according to the above definition, which one of the followings belongs to a virtual team?\n# Options:\nA) A publishing firm contacted several experts to jointly compile a new textbook. they work in different units and coordinating their work is mainly through telephone, fax and network.\nB) A company transferred each two key employees from the sales department, r&d department and production department to form a new product research team.\nC) Xiao li encountered technical problems in his work. he was not familiar with a professional field. he consulted many experts through the internet and telephone, and established regular and fixed contacts with the experts.\nD) Xiao tang, xiao sun and xiao liu often chat on the internet and find that they have similar experiences and common hobbies. so they become good friends.', "<think>.\nTo determine which option belongs to a virtual team, let's analyze each option based on the definition provided:.\n\n1.**Option A**: A publishing firm contacted several experts to jointly compile a new textbook.They work independently in the same unit and coordinating their work is mainly through face-to-face meetings and handwritten notes. This option does not fit the definition because it involves a single expert working alone within the same unit, using traditional methods to coordinate their efforts.\n\nB. Therefore, my final option is: "]]
