 also mentions that recently discovered gas clouds contained carbon elements billions of years ago.This suggests that the carbon element in the gas cloud could have been part of a planet that existed billions of years ago.Therefore, this option is likely true.The gas cloud with time is not the same as the planet.. Therefore, my final option is: "]]
