, it will seriously affect the local economic and social development.\n- This option implies that the APEC governance model, if continued, would have negative consequences for the local economy and society.This could also be a factor contributing to people's confusion.\n\nD) The image of our country will not be affected by frequent haze in Beijing during the APEC meeting, as this option does not prioritize the effects on the country's image over practical difficulties or economic/social impacts.. Therefore, my final option is: "]]
