messages:  [["Please solve the logical reasoning problem.\nGiven a context and a question, answer with the correct option: A, B, C or D. Please reason step by step.\n####\n# Context:\nPsychologists have found that, in general, students' attention varies with the time the teacher gives.At the beginning of the lecture, the student's attention will be greatly enhanced, and for a period of time in the middle to maintain a more ideal state. Then, the students' attention will begin to be distracted.\n\n# Question:\nBased on the above information, which of the following options, if correct, best weakens the above conclusions?\n# Options:\nA) The teacher is well-arranged to get enough attention\nB) There will always be a few students who can stay focused throughout\nC) Interest is a key factor in the ability to concentrate\nD) The time a person can fully concentrate is only 7 seconds", 'FAILED. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
