 the definition of corporate social response as it shows a commitment to addressing a societal issue (pollution) through ethical and moral means.Providing employment opportunities for individuals with disabilities is not a requirement of the law on the protection of the disabled, so a company should not arrange for such arrangements.. Therefore, my final option is: "]]
