pensive farming methods employ topsoil aeration techniques other than deep tillage.\n- This option is not directly related to the context or the argument.It introduces a new concept about the cost of farming methods, which is not relevant to the argument's focus on the relationship between tillage depth and erosion susceptibility.\nDeep tillage is always the most viable option, regardless of the method used.. Therefore, my final option is: "]]
