 the English tutoring class.\nThis option does not strengthen the argument because it only describes who attends the tutoring class, not why they should attend.Attending an English tutoring class is not necessary for passing the postgraduate entrance examination.\n\nD) If you attend the English tutoring class, you will be able to pass the postgraduate entrance examination.\n. Therefore, my final option is: "]]
