mperature).This is an example of environmental effects.\n\nThe option mentions a coastal city reclaiming the sea to construct an island, leading to the creation of a small town capable of housing 70,000 individuals. This instance highlights the positive impact of human actions on the environment, showcasing how development can enhance natural surroundings.\n\nGiven the evaluation, option D exemplifies an environmental benefit by illustrating how human interventions can improve the environment rather than causing harm.\n</reflect>.\n<response>\n. Therefore, my final option is: "]]
