ary activities over time.\n\nB) Chen has worked as a deputy director of the magazine for 20 years, and although he has published some personal works, he has not been promoted.\n- This option suggests that Chen's ability to advance in his career has been hindered due to his lack of promotion.While this could be related to self-depletion, it does not explicitly state a decline in ability or willingness to conduct voluntary activities over time.\n\nC) Song mou do sales work for nearly ten years, although he changed four or five companies, but because the performance is average, the income has not changed.\n- This option describes a situation where Song Mou's performance has been average, leading to no significant change in his income despite changing jobs.This could be indicative of self-depletion, as he may feel demotivated and disengaged from his work.\n\nThis option clearly shows that Wang is passionate about his work and eager to advance in his career. It highlights his dedication and drive to excel, which contradicts the concept of self-depletion.. Therefore, my final option is: "]]
