 from the elite to the public.\n- While this option is mentioned in the context, it is not the primary focus or emphasis.The context discusses the rise of various entrepreneurial subjects, but it does not specifically emphasize this shift.\n\nC) Mechanism and system hinder the realization of human value.\n- This option is also mentioned in the context, but it is not the primary focus or emphasis.The context discusses the imperfect mechanism and system, but it does not specifically emphasize this hindrance.Neglecting people's value is the foundation of mass entrepreneurship and innovation.\n- The context specifically highlights the significance of creating an institutional environment for mass entrepreneurship and innovation, rather than focusing on protecting people's value.\n\nBased on the analysis, the emphasized option is B) The reform should not facilitate an institutional environment for mass entrepreneurship and innovation.\n. Therefore, my final option is: "]]
